# This directory is evaluation-only and is ignored by the repo root .gitignore.
# This second ignore exists so that removing the outer rule cannot silently start
# committing personal photographs, downloaded originals or test verdicts.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md

# The read-only guard is the ONE exception, and it is deliberately narrow: a named file,
# not a pattern. The binary beside it (.osxphotos-raw) stays ignored, as does everything
# else. The guard is the safety mechanism — it belongs under review and under test.
!bin/
bin/*
!bin/osxphotos
# Provenance for that binary — pinned commit, SHA-256, and the PyInstaller patch the build
# needs. It is the recipe for reproducing a security-sensitive artifact, so it belongs
# under review too. The binary itself (.osxphotos-raw, 28MB) stays out.
!bin/BUILD.txt
